title: 'election-provider-support: fix MaxEncodedLen undercount in generated solution
  types'
doc:
- audience: Runtime Dev
  description: "The prefix budget assumed a one-byte length prefix per vote field,\
    \ but a field holding `MaxVoters` elements uses a multi-byte `compact. Budget\
    \ Compact(MaxVoters).encoded_size()` for the full field, and cover it with a test\
    \ using `MaxVoters = 64`.\r\n"
crates:
- name: frame-election-provider-solution-type
  bump: patch
- name: frame-election-provider-support
  bump: patch
